"""
DEEP CLEAN — Ocean Cleanup Dive
A Python/Pygame port of the browser game.

Pilot a little submarine down through darkening water, scoop up drifting
debris for points + oxygen, and dodge jellyfish and currents. The deeper
you go, the faster things fall and the less oxygen you have to spare.

Requirements:
    pip install pygame numpy

Run:
    python ocean_cleanup.py

Controls:
    Arrow keys / WASD  - move the submarine
    M                  - mute / unmute music
    Space / Enter      - start dive / dive again
    Esc                - quit
"""

